      "authorId": "UC95lkG1mOEIU3ciOeBWRwTA",
      "text": "What i love about this title is that when you are the first Designer hire, without the title, you end up doing some of the Founding Designer role.\n\nSo you might end up:\n- Designing the app, marketing website, logo, social media assets\n- Front end skills\n- Frequent meetings with founders\n- Managing expectations with founders, developers, marketing\n- Talking with developers\n- Understand the business problems with marketing \n- Talking to sales\n- Burning out",
